{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/021d8e3cbfc5abaf503aa86050e3c363.avif?t=1755517107\" width=1600 height=589 /></span><i>Sweet Dreams Caf\u00e9</i> is a polished, premium experience with 3 full chapters and over 400 levels already playable. We\u2019re launching in Early Access to understand the appetite for casual puzzle games on Steam and invite players to help shape the final chapter of Amira\u2019s story. Your feedback will guide how we move forward toward full release.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc1 <strong>Premium Puzzle Gameplay</strong><br>No microtransactions. No energy timers. Just a beautifully balanced, pay-once experience designed for puzzle lovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf70 <strong>Match Cakes &amp; Solve Challenges</strong><br>Match pastries to complete hundreds of handcrafted levels. Use boosters  to overcome tricky puzzles and earn coins to renovate your caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/c3b1e4b60cfb06db0d12aa9a8214825e.poster.avif?t=1755517107\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/c3b1e4b60cfb06db0d12aa9a8214825e.webm?t=1755517107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/c3b1e4b60cfb06db0d12aa9a8214825e.mp4?t=1755517107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Renovate Your P\u00e2tisserie</strong><br>Restore and decorate the bakery, patio, garden, and shopfront. Unlock new spaces and create a warm, inviting place for a diverse cast of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/c39d4f0a5a6de03b22f788c571c0a10d.poster.avif?t=1755517107\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/c39d4f0a5a6de03b22f788c571c0a10d.webm?t=1755517107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/c39d4f0a5a6de03b22f788c571c0a10d.mp4?t=1755517107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Shape the Story</strong><br>Help Amira become part of her new community. Discover new relationships, explore personal growth, and maybe even find love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/fbf4c1976a76f2e783614c322e5d2748.poster.avif?t=1755517107\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/fbf4c1976a76f2e783614c322e5d2748.webm?t=1755517107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/fbf4c1976a76f2e783614c322e5d2748.mp4?t=1755517107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Explore Paris</strong><br>Customize your caf\u00e9 to fit into a chic Parisian neighborhood. Discover new streets, meet locals, and build a life full of dreams and pastries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/723d49f72e3f67505741ff68eabfa86a.poster.avif?t=1755517107\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/723d49f72e3f67505741ff68eabfa86a.webm?t=1755517107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/723d49f72e3f67505741ff68eabfa86a.mp4?t=1755517107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Join the Baking League</strong><br>Beat the last level to enter the baking league and compete with other top bakers on Steam leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Now \u2013 Chapters 1 to 3 Available!</strong><br>Help us shape the final chapter and bring Amira\u2019s story to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Concept art \u2013 represents potential future locations and rooms to explore</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/3e90f2ed909d3f48bfc5113b2200d552.avif?t=1755517107\" data-has-big width=1600 height=1560 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902590?t=1755517107","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/50681414773c1da191c8d19b19510154fad084e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755517107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/1ad43c7b4cc541a1d5386989393d81636447b34f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755517107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/1ad43c7b4cc541a1d5386989393d81636447b34f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755517107","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/021d8e3cbfc5abaf503aa86050e3c363.avif?t=1755517107\" width=1600 height=589 /></span><i>Sweet Dreams Caf\u00e9</i> is a polished, premium experience with 3 full chapters and over 400 levels already playable. We\u2019re launching in Early Access to understand the appetite for casual puzzle games on Steam and invite players to help shape the final chapter of Amira\u2019s story. Your feedback will guide how we move forward toward full release.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc1 <strong>Premium Puzzle Gameplay</strong><br>No microtransactions. No energy timers. Just a beautifully balanced, pay-once experience designed for puzzle lovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf70 <strong>Match Cakes &amp; Solve Challenges</strong><br>Match pastries to complete hundreds of handcrafted levels. Use boosters  to overcome tricky puzzles and earn coins to renovate your caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/c3b1e4b60cfb06db0d12aa9a8214825e.poster.avif?t=1755517107\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/c3b1e4b60cfb06db0d12aa9a8214825e.webm?t=1755517107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor