a5633fa8c/ss_a3c796799f51d21a2835126427a62eea5633fa8c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755517107","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/a3c796799f51d21a2835126427a62eea5633fa8c/ss_a3c796799f51d21a2835126427a62eea5633fa8c.600x338.jpg?t=1755517107"}],"short_description":"Build your dream caf\u00e9 in the heart of Paris in this premium (no in game purchases) match experience. Match pastries, meet eccentric characters, make story choices, and transform a corner caf\u00e9 into a world-renowned hotspot. Unlock stylish upgrades, and serve up dreams with every level! Bon app\u00e9tit!","steam_appid":3902590,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://outplay.helpshift.com/hc/en/12-sweet-dreams-cafe/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Korean, Russian, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":null}